#: ../../source/glossary.rst:2 5e0d1522c32f4feabfc62f43f70e7ec1
msgid "术语表"
msgstr "Glossary"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:4 8f75bd6ad2a9408286f83b63eb7fd318
msgid ""
"本页整理使用 Godot-FmodPlayer 时常见的 FMOD 与音频术语。内容参考 `FMOD API Glossary "
"<https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.04/api/glossary.html>`_， 并根据 Godot 引擎、FMOD Core API 与 Godot-"
"FmodPlayer 的实际用法重新说明。"
msgstr ""
"This page collects common FMOD and audio terms used with Godot-FmodPlayer. It refers to the `FMOD"
" API Glossary <https://www.fmod.com/docs/2.04/api/glossary.html>`_ and adapts the explanations to"
" Godot Engine, the FMOD Core API, and Godot-FmodPlayer usage."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:10 59e46e16823a4cfe8928bfd4b8ca5401
msgid ""
"本页不是 FMOD 官方文档的中文翻译，也不替代 FMOD 官方许可、API 文档或技术支持。 FMOD、FMOD Engine 等名称归 Firelight Technologies Pty "
"Ltd 所有。发布项目时请以 `FMOD Legal Information <https://www.fmod.com/legal>`_ 与 `FMOD Licensing "
"<https://www.fmod.com/licensing>`_ 为准。"
msgstr ""
"This page is not an official Chinese translation of the FMOD documentation and does not replace "
"the official FMOD license, API documentation, or technical support. Names such as FMOD and FMOD "
"Engine belong to Firelight Technologies Pty Ltd. When publishing a project, always follow `FMOD "
"Legal Information <https://www.fmod.com/legal>`_ and the official licensing terms."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:18 89a793afec3e42e6a4075b70d13b10dc
msgid "2D 与 3D"
msgstr "2D and 3D"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:20 6ccd378e8d914a91ab9b48c48161901e
msgid ""
"2D 声音不会参与空间定位。它通常适合 UI 音效、背景音乐、旁白、菜单音效等不需要跟随场景位置变化的声音。 在 Godot-FmodPlayer "
"中，:ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer>` 默认更接近 2D 播放用法。"
msgstr ""
"2D sounds do not participate in spatial positioning. They are usually suitable for UI sound "
"effects, background music, narration, menu sounds, and other sounds that do not need to follow "
"scene positions. In Godot-FmodPlayer, :ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer>` "
"is closer to the default 2D playback workflow."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:23 8a171dc09b7d4e3bb8b1ed3415a16c65
msgid ""
"3D 声音会根据声源和监听器之间的位置关系计算音量、声像、距离衰减、遮挡和多普勒效果。 在 Godot-FmodPlayer "
"中，:ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>` 会把 Godot 节点的全局位置同步到 FMOD 通道， "
"适合脚步、武器、环境物件、车辆、怪物叫声等来自世界空间的声音。"
msgstr ""
"3D sounds calculate volume, pan, distance attenuation, occlusion, and Doppler effects from the "
"relationship between the sound source and the listener. In Godot-FmodPlayer, "
":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>` synchronizes the Godot node global "
"position to the FMOD channel."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:29 1c5abaa0778e4014a89a4466a038c721
msgid ""
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.set_3d_level()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_set_3d_level>` 可以调整 3D "
"混合比例。 这在需要让一个声音部分保持空间感、部分保持稳定声像时很有用。"
msgstr ""
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.set_3d_level()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_set_3d_level>` adjusts "
"the 3D blend amount. This is useful when a sound should keep some spatial feeling while retaining"
" a stable pan image."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:35 8579629525054c02a435287107c33316
msgid "音频资产"
msgstr "Audio Asset"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:37 2ed49041fea7421b9d73bf541481146a
msgid "音频资产是项目中可播放的声音数据。它可以是 ``wav``、``ogg``、``mp3``、``flac`` 等独立音频文件， 也可以是运行时已经能够读取的其他 FMOD 支持格式。"
msgstr ""
"An audio asset is playable sound data in the project. It may be an independent audio file such as"
" ``wav``, ``ogg``, ``mp3``, or ``flac``, or another runtime-readable format supported by FMOD."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:40 36ffe2d656ca483589e3127f0408e16f
msgid ""
"在 Godot-FmodPlayer 中，常见做法是把音频文件导入为 :ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>`， 再交给 "
":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer>`、:ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D>`"
" 或 :ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>` 播放。"
msgstr ""
"In Godot-FmodPlayer, the common workflow is to import audio files as "
":ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>` and play them through "
":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer>`, "
":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D>`, or "
":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>`."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:47 b96d2b327e974f738ba02812fa2cc741
msgid "音频通道"
msgstr "Audio Channel"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:49 06633ed231ad49e7831a2dc3983dfa22
msgid "音频通道可以指两种不同概念，需要区分："
msgstr "Audio channel can mean two different things, so the distinction matters:"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:51 283e1e8981df485eba82c6d00d238fe8
msgid "**声道**：音频信号里的扬声器通道，例如单声道、左声道、右声道、5.1 环绕声中的多个输出通道。"
msgstr ""
"**Speaker channel**: A speaker channel in the audio signal, such as mono, left, right, or "
"multiple output channels in 5.1 surround."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:52 a7959d7e5c694ec1a2d6f0bf22683531
msgid "**FMOD Channel**：FMOD 中的一次声音播放实例，对应 Godot-FmodPlayer 的 :ref:`FmodChannel<class_FmodChannel>`。"
msgstr ""
"**FMOD Channel**: One sound playback instance in FMOD, corresponding to "
":ref:`FmodChannel<class_FmodChannel>` in Godot-FmodPlayer."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:54 1f11b023ecf2455ca0dd9635e1e7ffb2
msgid ""
"例如，一个立体声音效文件有两个声道；当它被播放一次时，FMOD 会为这次播放创建或分配一个 Channel。 同一个声音同时播放三次，就可能对应三个不同的 "
":ref:`FmodChannel<class_FmodChannel>`。"
msgstr ""
"For example, a stereo sound effect file has two speaker channels. When it is played once, FMOD "
"creates or assigns one Channel for that playback. If the same sound plays three times at once, it"
" may correspond to three different :ref:`FmodChannel<class_FmodChannel>` objects."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:60 8454bfb2ee34423780c1f41843c32798
msgid "Bus"
msgstr "Bus"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:62 9c464ca65b724f7c9039e235362a23d4
msgid "Bus 即音频总线，用来把一组声音集中到同一个混音路径上。常见总线包括 ``Music``、``SFX``、``Voice`` 和 ``Ambient``。"
msgstr ""
"A Bus is an audio bus used to collect a group of sounds into the same mixing route. Common buses "
"include ``Music``, ``SFX``, ``Voice``, and ``Ambient``."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:64 e166c235e6d94401bdf3322eb3488e1e
msgid ""
"默认开启 ``audio/fmod/sync_godot_audio_buses``，将 Godot 的 `AudioServer`_ 配置同步到 FMOD。关闭同步并重新加载项目后，可在 "
"FMOD Audio 面板中编辑独立的 "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>`。:ref:`FmodAudioBus<class_FmodAudioBus>` 和 "
":ref:`FmodChannelGroup<class_FmodChannelGroup>` 管理实际混音，详见 :ref:`混音系统<mixer>`。"
msgstr ""
"``audio/fmod/sync_godot_audio_buses`` is enabled by default and mirrors the Godot `AudioServer`_ "
"configuration to FMOD. Disable synchronization and reload the project to edit an independent "
":ref:`FmodAudioBusLayout<class_FmodAudioBusLayout>` in FMOD Audio. "
":ref:`FmodAudioBus<class_FmodAudioBus>` and :ref:`FmodChannelGroup<class_FmodChannelGroup>` "
"manage live mixing. See :ref:`Mixing system<mixer>`."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:69 d554bcc5d5534c88b09f2ad22a38ca37
msgid "Channel"
msgstr "Channel"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:71 49de58aee9d547ed898eedf2a57de654
msgid "Channel 是 FMOD 中一次正在播放或由虚拟语音系统托管的声音实例。它可以控制音量、暂停、音高、循环点、播放位置、 3D 属性、DSP 链和回调。"
msgstr ""
"A Channel is one sound instance currently playing in FMOD, or managed by the virtual voice "
"system. It can control volume, pause, pitch, loop points, playback position, 3D properties, DSP "
"chains, and callbacks."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:74 7604a0a521454fdbbe446a244994f402
msgid ""
"在 Godot-FmodPlayer 中，播放节点内部会维护一个 :ref:`FmodChannel<class_FmodChannel>`。 如果需要更细的控制，可以取得当前播放通道，再调用 "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl<class_FmodChannelControl>` 或 :ref:`FmodChannel<class_FmodChannel>` 的方法。"
msgstr ""
"In Godot-FmodPlayer, playback nodes maintain a :ref:`FmodChannel<class_FmodChannel>` internally. "
"If finer control is needed, get the current playback channel and call "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl<class_FmodChannelControl>` or :ref:`FmodChannel<class_FmodChannel>` "
"methods."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:81 98f82b5d19d04f2ea4379c0a2ef5d391
msgid "ChannelGroup"
msgstr "ChannelGroup"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:83 b3549305194e44b49bff2746bc580919
msgid ""
"ChannelGroup 是多个 Channel 或子 ChannelGroup 的混音容器。它适合做分组控制，例如同时降低所有音乐音量、 暂停一组环境声，或给整个 ``SFX`` "
"总线添加一个滤波器。"
msgstr ""
"A ChannelGroup is a mixing container for multiple Channels or child ChannelGroups. It is useful "
"for grouped control, such as lowering all music, pausing a group of ambience sounds, or adding a "
"filter to the whole ``SFX`` bus."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:86 4587cf50a9ec4b9485ad1e14d4294256
msgid ""
"在 Godot-FmodPlayer 中，:ref:`FmodChannelGroup<class_FmodChannelGroup>` 通常由总线系统创建和管理。 普通项目优先通过 "
":doc:`user_guide/mixer` 中的总线接口操作；只有在需要底层控制时才直接访问 ChannelGroup。"
msgstr ""
"In Godot-FmodPlayer, :ref:`FmodChannelGroup<class_FmodChannelGroup>` is usually created and "
"managed by the bus system. For regular projects, prefer the bus APIs described in "
":doc:`user_guide/mixer`; access ChannelGroup directly only when lower-level control is needed."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:92 84b78a99981640b4be2b0a3670406a61
msgid "ChannelControl"
msgstr "ChannelControl"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:94 e2385a331e904b03938f22fd410ca797
msgid "ChannelControl 是 Channel 和 ChannelGroup 共享的一组控制能力。它包含音量、静音、暂停、音高、3D 属性、声像矩阵、 DSP 插入、淡变点和回调等接口。"
msgstr ""
"ChannelControl is the shared control surface of Channel and ChannelGroup. It includes APIs for "
"volume, mute, pause, pitch, 3D properties, pan matrix, DSP insertion, fade points, and callbacks."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:97 f4249bcb08f24b56a0ad5f15e528af8b
msgid ""
"Godot-FmodPlayer 中的 :ref:`FmodChannel<class_FmodChannel>` 与 "
":ref:`FmodChannelGroup<class_FmodChannelGroup>` 都继承自 "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl<class_FmodChannelControl>`。因此，很多播放控制方法既能用于单个声音，也能用于一整组声音。"
msgstr ""
"Both :ref:`FmodChannel<class_FmodChannel>` and :ref:`FmodChannelGroup<class_FmodChannelGroup>` in"
" Godot-FmodPlayer inherit from :ref:`FmodChannelControl<class_FmodChannelControl>`, so many "
"playback and mixing controls are shared."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:103 89f43f9009dd416fa9d64a1ca8a1cb80
msgid "DSP"
msgstr "DSP"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:105 ff6e813159b84c6ca7ce32952b92d6cd
msgid "DSP 是 Digital Signal Processing 的缩写，表示数字信号处理单元。混响、均衡器、滤波器、延迟、失真、压缩器、 频谱分析器等都可以作为 DSP 参与音频处理。"
msgstr ""
"DSP stands for Digital Signal Processing. Reverb, equalizers, filters, delay, distortion, "
"compressors, and spectrum analyzers can all participate in audio processing as DSP units."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:108 ff220e800b144705a17d112ebe4c825b
msgid ""
"在 Godot-FmodPlayer 中，:ref:`FmodDSP<class_FmodDSP>` 可以添加到某个 Channel、ChannelGroup 或总线相关的混音路径上。 "
"如果多个声音需要同一种效果，通常把 DSP 放在对应总线上更容易维护，也比给每个声音单独创建效果更省资源。"
msgstr ""
"In Godot-FmodPlayer, :ref:`FmodDSP<class_FmodDSP>` can be added to a Channel, ChannelGroup, or "
"bus-related mixing route. If multiple sounds need the same effect, placing the DSP on the "
"corresponding bus is usually easier to maintain and cheaper than creating the effect for every "
"sound."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:114 d0cd2bd460004a4191b51368c9019573
msgid "DSP 链"
msgstr "DSP Chain"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:116 e8814aa5b09643feb9a300f037eb420c
msgid "DSP 链是多个 DSP 按顺序连接形成的处理路径。声音进入链后，会依次经过这些处理单元。 不同顺序会产生不同结果，例如先失真再混响，和先混响再失真，听感通常不同。"
msgstr ""
"A DSP chain is a processing path formed by connecting multiple DSPs in order. Once sound enters "
"the chain, it passes through each processing unit sequentially. Different orders produce "
"different results; distortion before reverb usually sounds different from reverb before "
"distortion."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:121 d3f4be8cd51b4c5c923da1ebeea047b9
msgid ""
"在 Godot-FmodPlayer 中，可以通过 "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.add_dsp()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_add_dsp>`、 "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.remove_dsp()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_remove_dsp>` 和 "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.set_dsp_index()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_set_dsp_index>` 调整 DSP "
"链。"
msgstr ""
"In Godot-FmodPlayer, you can control the chain with "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.add_dsp()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_add_dsp>`, "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.remove_dsp()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_remove_dsp>`, and "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.set_dsp_index()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_set_dsp_index>`."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:128 44caa0e92e884a44b433eb0ce647d77b
msgid "DSP Clock"
msgstr "DSP Clock"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:130 89b90fc882e248e3a228b1746b4b5710
msgid "DSP Clock 是 FMOD 混音器使用的样本级时间计数。它常用于精确调度播放、延迟启动、淡入淡出或和其他声音对齐。"
msgstr ""
"DSP Clock is FMOD mixer time counted at sample precision. It is commonly used for precise "
"playback scheduling, delayed starts, fades, or aligning sounds."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:132 747a3d7a89d54a9e91d441b92ce2a41b
msgid ""
"在 Godot-FmodPlayer "
"中，:ref:`FmodChannelControl.get_dsp_clock()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_get_dsp_clock>`、 "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.set_delay()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_set_delay>` "
"和淡变点接口可以用于需要样本级同步的场景。 普通按钮音效和环境声通常不需要直接处理 DSP Clock。"
msgstr ""
"In Godot-FmodPlayer, APIs such as "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.get_dsp_clock()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_get_dsp_clock>` and "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.set_delay()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_set_delay>` expose related "
"timing controls."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:139 b569202bbd2643b2a19dec4d18e81920
msgid "Listener"
msgstr "Listener"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:141 93cdba3fb10f413886da424da1d48462
msgid "Listener 即监听器，表示玩家“听见世界”的位置和朝向。3D 声音会根据监听器与声源之间的距离、方向和相对速度计算结果。"
msgstr ""
"A Listener represents where the player hears the world from, including position and orientation. "
"3D sounds are calculated from the distance, direction, and relative velocity between the listener"
" and the source."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:143 a9e2851306bb49e08e1849bc821ba00e
msgid ""
"当前插件在游戏中读取视口的 Camera3D 或 Camera2D 作为监听来源，3D 编辑器试听使用编辑器相机。原生 ``AudioListener3D`` 不会自动接管 FMOD "
"监听器。使用 :ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>` 时，检查活动相机、声源变换和距离设置。"
msgstr ""
"The current plugin uses the viewport's Camera3D or Camera2D as the game listener source, and the "
"editor camera for 3D editor previews. A native ``AudioListener3D`` does not automatically take "
"over the FMOD listener. When using :ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>`,"
" check the active camera, source transform, and distance settings."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:148 ddd1980139d84a61af97b28565faf625
msgid "Sound"
msgstr "Sound"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:150 1005ff2a5d8b43149200357be215427c
msgid "Sound 是 FMOD 对音频数据的运行时表示。它通常由文件、内存数据或流式数据创建，然后通过 System 播放为 Channel。"
msgstr ""
"Sound is FMOD's runtime representation of audio data. It is usually created from a file, memory "
"data, or streaming data, and then played by the System as a Channel."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:152 aaaa3f1403f24fd88d7d1af20af748f1
msgid ""
"在 Godot-FmodPlayer 中，:ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>` 会在需要时创建底层 "
":ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>`。 这让资源可以先作为 Godot 资源存在，真正播放或查询底层对象时再交给 FMOD 创建声音。"
msgstr ""
"In Godot-FmodPlayer, :ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>` creates the underlying "
":ref:`FmodSound<class_FmodSound>` only when needed. This lets the resource exist as a Godot "
"resource first, and only hand the sound to FMOD when playback or low-level access is required."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:158 ed343ef1584e449c939aa28bd5d71c99
msgid "Stream 与 Sample"
msgstr "Stream and Sample"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:160 6f27ae584a024c12b1033a3708ed6da0
msgid "Stream 表示边读取边解码的播放方式，适合音乐、长旁白、长环境声等体积较大的音频。 Sample 表示把音频数据加载到内存后播放，适合短音效、频繁触发的 UI 声和需要低延迟响应的声音。"
msgstr ""
"Stream means audio is read and decoded while playing, which is suitable for large audio such as "
"music, long narration, and long ambience. Sample means the audio data is loaded into memory "
"before playback, which is suitable for short sound effects, frequently triggered UI sounds, and "
"low-latency responses."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:163 33e22eac04454058b644fca1f36eeb7b
msgid ""
"在 Godot-FmodPlayer 中，可以通过 :ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>` 的创建模式选择更适合的加载方式。 "
"一般来说，长音频优先使用流式播放，短音效优先使用样本加载。"
msgstr ""
"In Godot-FmodPlayer, you choose the more suitable loading method through the creation mode of "
":ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>`. In general, prefer streaming for long audio and "
"sample loading for short sound effects."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:169 c20e2e83a2534792a3e17f23cedbaced
msgid "Virtual Channel"
msgstr "Virtual Channel"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:171 b65f22652f5443be8f6f3d1ef7ddce3d
msgid "Virtual Channel 即虚拟通道。当同时播放的声音很多时，FMOD 可以让听不见或优先级较低的声音进入虚拟状态。 虚拟通道仍然保留播放时间和状态，但不一定消耗完整的混音资源。"
msgstr ""
"A Virtual Channel is a channel in FMOD's virtual voice system. When many sounds play at the same "
"time, FMOD may virtualize inaudible or low-priority sounds. A virtual channel keeps playback time"
" and state, but may not consume full mixing resources."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:174 45d692c4579d4ee5ade81bc0ed53f07f
msgid ""
"在 Godot-FmodPlayer 中，可以通过 :ref:`FmodChannel.is_virtual()<class_FmodChannel_method_is_virtual>` "
"查询某个通道是否处于虚拟状态。 这对调试大量环境声、粒子音效或开放世界场景中的声音预算很有帮助。"
msgstr ""
"In Godot-FmodPlayer, :ref:`FmodChannel.is_virtual()<class_FmodChannel_method_is_virtual>` can "
"query whether a channel is virtual. This is useful when debugging large ambience sets, particle "
"sounds, or sound budgets in open-world scenes."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:180 988d546a00e349f9b6c4562d78da9e40
msgid "Rolloff"
msgstr "Rolloff"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:182 45b0cd31a5a147d0af391257b7ecba0e
msgid "Rolloff 表示 3D 声音随距离变远而衰减的曲线。不同曲线会影响声音从近处到远处的听感变化。"
msgstr ""
"Rolloff is the curve describing how a 3D sound attenuates as distance increases. Different curves"
" change how the sound feels from near to far."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:184 81020d4609e14c76b7d9d6ffa1ba5b7e
msgid ""
"3D 播放节点通过 ``unit_size`` 缩放距离，``max_distance`` 是其倍数，并非通用的硬截止距离；衰减曲线由 ``attenuation_model`` 选择。低层 "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl<class_FmodChannelControl>` 则提供 ``set_3d_min_max_distance()`` "
"和自定义衰减曲线接口。先确认所用层级及其距离单位，再调整衰减行为。"
msgstr ""
"The 3D player scales distances with ``unit_size``; ``max_distance`` is a multiplier of that "
"value, not a universal hard cutoff. Select the rolloff model with ``attenuation_model``. The "
"lower-level :ref:`FmodChannelControl<class_FmodChannelControl>` provides "
"``set_3d_min_max_distance()`` and custom rolloff interfaces. Check which API level and distance "
"units you are using before tuning attenuation."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:189 6dfc8076989340c9bc2c9957c1da8794
msgid "Doppler"
msgstr "Doppler"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:191 570b784176614a9686c287234992f968
msgid "Doppler 即多普勒效果。当声源和监听器之间存在相对速度时，音高会发生变化。 快速掠过的车辆、飞行物或高速移动的物体可以使用该效果增强速度感。"
msgstr ""
"Doppler is the pitch shift caused by relative velocity between a sound source and the listener. "
"Fast passing vehicles, projectiles, or moving objects can use it to enhance the sense of speed."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:194 eccba9ad86ea468c9661166cb079868e
msgid ""
"在 Godot-FmodPlayer 中，:ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>` 会同步位置和速度相关信息。 "
"如果效果过强或不符合游戏风格，可以通过多普勒相关设置降低影响。"
msgstr ""
"In Godot-FmodPlayer, :ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>` synchronizes "
"position and velocity information. If the effect is too strong or does not fit the game style, "
"reduce the Doppler-related settings."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:200 752c3284c84d4bcdb1ae5c8c4d7c631f
msgid "Occlusion"
msgstr "Occlusion"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:202 ce795cee7a3644a185524fd3335b50c1
msgid "Occlusion 即遮挡。它描述墙体、地形或其他几何体阻挡声音传播后，音量和高频内容被削弱的效果。"
msgstr ""
"Occlusion describes how walls, terrain, or other geometry block sound propagation, reducing "
"volume and high-frequency content."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:204 ea420500076c4bbaafdd8d1318e5e43a
msgid ""
"Godot-FmodPlayer 提供 :ref:`FmodGeometryInstance3D<class_FmodGeometryInstance3D>`，可以把场景几何体注册到 FMOD "
"Geometry 系统。 适合需要门后声音、墙后声音、房间隔音等空间表现的项目。"
msgstr ""
"Godot-FmodPlayer provides :ref:`FmodGeometryInstance3D<class_FmodGeometryInstance3D>` to register"
" scene geometry with FMOD Geometry. It is suitable for projects that need sounds behind doors, "
"sounds behind walls, or room isolation effects."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:210 2edf712338de493faa01aaa1a4659331
msgid "Pan 与 Mix Matrix"
msgstr "Pan and Mix Matrix"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:212 2d126fc743084ff9add6ac94b55d5aa5
msgid "Pan 即声像，通常用于控制声音在左右声道或环绕声场中的位置。Mix Matrix 则是更底层的输入到输出声道矩阵， 可以精确控制每个输入声道如何分配到输出声道。"
msgstr ""
"Pan usually controls where a sound sits in the left/right channels or surround field. Mix Matrix "
"is a lower-level input-to-output channel matrix that can precisely control how each input channel"
" is distributed to output channels."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:215 f8c2968e08144d078deaf3b212ec386c
msgid ""
"在 Godot-FmodPlayer 中，简单左右声像可以使用 "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.set_pan()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_set_pan>`。 如果需要多声道或特殊路由，可以使用 "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.set_mix_matrix()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_set_mix_matrix>`。"
msgstr ""
"In Godot-FmodPlayer, simple left/right panning can use "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.set_pan()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_set_pan>`. For multi-channel "
"or special routing, use "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.set_mix_matrix()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_set_mix_matrix>`."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:221 d76593b5d7144bc999f223b9803ac703
msgid "Mix Matrix"
msgstr "Mix Matrix"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:223 a092dddd54b6493280157a1246b695b5
msgid ""
"Mix Matrix 即混音矩阵，用来控制 **输入声道** 如何分配到 **输出声道**。 可以把它理解成一张权重表：每一列是一个输入声道，每一行是一个输出声道，表格中的数值表示 "
"“这个输入声道有多少信号送到这个输出声道”。"
msgstr ""
"Mix Matrix controls how **input channels** are distributed to **output channels**. You can think "
"of it as a weight table: each column is an input channel, each row is an output channel, and each"
" value says how much of that input channel is sent to that output channel."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:227 7d70a0b3b444445cba11de1a0f67735c
msgid "以一个立体声输入原样送到立体声输出为例："
msgstr "For example, a stereo input sent unchanged to stereo output:"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:229 f371270c5b9c4f7e82c4c395dcb53e63
msgid "立体声输入原样输出到立体声输出的混音矩阵"
msgstr "Mix matrix that preserves a stereo input at the stereo output"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:234 f83eb661d4364235b422f18ccc78d13e
msgid "这个矩阵表示左声道只进左扬声器，右声道只进右扬声器。用更直观的形式写就是："
msgstr ""
"This matrix means the left channel goes only to the left speaker, and the right channel goes only"
" to the right speaker. Written more directly:"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:236 744af7921b8f41b69375e780c3d8d4af
msgid ""
"输出 L = 输入 L * 1.0 + 输入 R * 0.0\n"
"输出 R = 输入 L * 0.0 + 输入 R * 1.0"
msgstr ""
"Output L = Input L * 1.0 + Input R * 0.0\n"
"Output R = Input L * 0.0 + Input R * 1.0"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:241 d40bc076332d481ea54b50476a0ebd08
msgid ""
"在 Godot-FmodPlayer "
"中，:ref:`FmodChannelControl.set_mix_matrix()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_set_mix_matrix>` 接收一个"
" ``PackedFloat32Array``，并指定输出声道数、输入声道数和输入声道步长。 矩阵按“输出行优先”的方式书写：先写输出 0 接收各输入的权重，再写输出 1，以此类推。"
msgstr ""
"In Godot-FmodPlayer, "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.set_mix_matrix()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_set_mix_matrix>` "
"accepts a ``PackedFloat32Array`` and specifies the output channel count, input channel count, and"
" input channel stride."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:245 6eb08ad307c14a258c59b555f2af1a44
msgid "下面示例把立体声左右声道对调："
msgstr "The example below swaps the left and right channels of a stereo sound:"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:247 982aaa734f9f404d925e1030ac093c24
msgid ""
"func swap_stereo(channel: FmodChannel) -> void:\n"
"    var matrix := PackedFloat32Array([\n"
"        0.0, 1.0, # Out L = In R\n"
"        1.0, 0.0, # Out R = In L\n"
"    ])\n"
"\n"
"    channel.set_mix_matrix(matrix, 2, 2)"
msgstr ""
"func swap_stereo(channel: FmodChannel) -> void:\n"
"    var matrix := PackedFloat32Array([\n"
"        0.0, 1.0, # Out L = In R\n"
"        1.0, 0.0, # Out R = In L\n"
"    ])\n"
"\n"
"    channel.set_mix_matrix(matrix, 2, 2)"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:257 101d446a88df47ff8c383fee3ce14a3a
msgid ""
"如果只是想调整单个播放实例的左右位置，优先使用 "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.set_pan()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_set_pan>`。 Mix Matrix "
"更适合处理多声道格式转换、特殊声道路由、左右声道互换、单声道偏置和调试音频资产等场景。"
msgstr ""
"If you only want to adjust the left/right position of one playback instance, prefer "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.set_pan()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_set_pan>`. Mix Matrix is "
"better for multi-channel format conversion, special channel routing, left/right swapping, mono "
"biasing, and debugging audio assets."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:264 55b8559a6ac04406a350919d1ba13fd9
msgid "Upmix"
msgstr "Upmix"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:266 612cb088db904f27998a564a38bf60ce
msgid "Upmix 即上混，是把较少的输入声道分配到更多输出声道。例如把单声道音效送到立体声输出， 或者把立体声音乐送到 5.1 输出。"
msgstr ""
"Upmix means distributing fewer input channels to more output channels. For example, sending a "
"mono sound effect to stereo output, or sending stereo music to 5.1 output."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:269 28d108346ef9429eb20522dc7e564908
msgid "最常见的单声道到立体声上混，是把同一份单声道信号同时送到左右声道。听感上它会位于正中间。 如果希望这个单声道声音偏左，可以降低右声道电平："
msgstr ""
"The most common mono-to-stereo upmix sends the same mono signal to both left and right channels, "
"which sounds centered. If you want the mono sound to lean left, reduce the right channel level:"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:272 819f006c03fd4fcabaf87124da73fb54
msgid "单声道上混到偏左立体声输出的混音矩阵"
msgstr "Mix matrix that upmixes mono to a left-biased stereo output"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:277 94d6f7e0aac54b80b84da6a71c59d3ac
msgid "对应代码可以写成："
msgstr "The corresponding code can be written as:"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:279 3895f0e8889e41859fc2b44044f56d88
msgid ""
"func mono_to_left_biased_stereo(channel: FmodChannel) -> void:\n"
"    var matrix := PackedFloat32Array([\n"
"        1.0,  # Out L = Mono * 1.0\n"
"        0.35, # Out R = Mono * 0.35\n"
"    ])\n"
"\n"
"    channel.set_mix_matrix(matrix, 2, 1)"
msgstr ""
"func mono_to_left_biased_stereo(channel: FmodChannel) -> void:\n"
"    var matrix := PackedFloat32Array([\n"
"        1.0,  # Out L = Mono * 1.0\n"
"        0.35, # Out R = Mono * 0.35\n"
"    ])\n"
"\n"
"    channel.set_mix_matrix(matrix, 2, 1)"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:289 9f524ca217214dd7ae7756b03746fd16
msgid ""
"在 Godot-FmodPlayer 中，简单左右声像通常直接用 "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.set_pan()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_set_pan>` 更方便。 "
"只有在需要精确控制多声道分配时，才需要手动设置混音矩阵。"
msgstr ""
"In Godot-FmodPlayer, simple left/right panning is usually easier with "
":ref:`FmodChannelControl.set_pan()<class_FmodChannelControl_method_set_pan>`. Manually set the "
"mix matrix only when precise multi-channel distribution is needed."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:296 7afa3ba5716b43e2b7806081ffda50fa
msgid "Downmix"
msgstr "Downmix"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:298 3c41608486fd40399f975d3b69a3c65d
msgid "Downmix 即下混，是把较多的输入声道折叠到较少输出声道。例如把立体声转为单声道， 或者把 5.1 输出到立体声设备。"
msgstr ""
"Downmix means folding more input channels into fewer output channels. For example, converting "
"stereo to mono, or outputting 5.1 content to a stereo device."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:301 f1c1c58714ef4d949ab04363f70b54ba
msgid "一个常见的立体声到单声道下混矩阵如下："
msgstr "A common stereo-to-mono downmix matrix is:"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:303 818ee366983a48d68b7e2ed8aa1a2767
msgid "立体声下混到单声道的混音矩阵"
msgstr "Mix matrix that downmixes stereo to mono"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:308 79ab569d76da4523b0ee061e78b45dd0
msgid "这表示左右声道各取一半相加："
msgstr "This means the left and right channels are each added at half level:"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:310 7966f16c32f14ea1a6ea3cb04ecf6f10
msgid "输出 Mono = 输入 L * 0.5 + 输入 R * 0.5"
msgstr "Output Mono = Input L * 0.5 + Input R * 0.5"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:314 9571141b31694cadb15121ac11451c21
msgid ""
"不要简单使用 ``1.0 + 1.0`` 做下混。两个满电平信号直接相加可能让输出超过正常范围， 造成削波或听感上的突然变大。实际项目里可以从 ``0.5``、``0.707`` "
"或更保守的值开始， 再根据素材响度和目标平台调整。"
msgstr ""
"Do not simply use ``1.0 + 1.0`` for downmixing. Adding two full-level signals directly can exceed"
" the normal range, causing clipping or a sudden loudness increase. In real projects, start with "
"``0.5``, ``0.707``, or a more conservative value, then adjust based on material loudness and the "
"target platform."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:318 c1ee454fda7344898ecf83686bec6a5b
msgid "代码示例："
msgstr "Code example:"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:320 3ddc81f904a1446ab4ff7b3c60537995
msgid ""
"func stereo_to_mono(channel: FmodChannel) -> void:\n"
"    var matrix := PackedFloat32Array([\n"
"        0.5, 0.5, # Out Mono = In L * 0.5 + In R * 0.5\n"
"    ])\n"
"\n"
"    channel.set_mix_matrix(matrix, 1, 2)"
msgstr ""
"func stereo_to_mono(channel: FmodChannel) -> void:\n"
"    var matrix := PackedFloat32Array([\n"
"        0.5, 0.5, # Out Mono = In L * 0.5 + In R * 0.5\n"
"    ])\n"
"\n"
"    channel.set_mix_matrix(matrix, 1, 2)"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:330 241434ea89de40269b23e0ca0143bf60
msgid "5.1 到立体声的简化示例"
msgstr "Simplified 5.1-to-stereo example"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:332 73fe98df840748ac8fa3f551105d2d6e
msgid "5.1 声道通常可以按以下顺序理解："
msgstr "5.1 channels can usually be understood in this order:"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:334 7fbd46f869eb4b63a83e5de6d851959a
msgid "Front Left, Front Right, Center, LFE, Surround Left, Surround Right"
msgstr "Front Left, Front Right, Center, LFE, Surround Left, Surround Right"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:338 52f3229d281f4adf8b83cc62b19d4e9e
msgid "一个简化的 5.1 到立体声下混矩阵可以写成："
msgstr "A simplified 5.1-to-stereo downmix matrix can be written as:"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:340 9d7250ac9ca84c6596c15af34e72cb64
msgid "5.1 声道下混到立体声的混音矩阵"
msgstr "Mix matrix that downmixes 5.1 audio to stereo"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:345 e86045790ffb499c8464c3aabd2fb7d8
msgid "这里的思路是："
msgstr "The idea is:"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:347 862044e12c4d481297bedfe928764b8a
msgid "左前和右前分别进入对应的左右输出。"
msgstr "Front left and front right go to the corresponding left and right outputs."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:348 8ec2a923a69c478484e27ba97b96ea67
msgid "中置声道同时进入左右输出，并降低到 ``0.707``，避免居中内容过响。"
msgstr ""
"The center channel goes to both left and right output, reduced to ``0.707`` to avoid making "
"centered content too loud."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:349 fab48e7d53ac48a88ad530f33bdc56b0
msgid "左环绕进入左输出，右环绕进入右输出，也适当降低。"
msgstr ""
"Surround left goes to left output, and surround right goes to right output, also reduced "
"appropriately."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:350 91424568658d4a42b43e8595750a8407
msgid "LFE 是低频效果声道，不一定适合直接混入普通立体声输出，是否加入要看项目需求。"
msgstr ""
"LFE is the low-frequency effects channel and may not be suitable for direct mixing into regular "
"stereo output; whether to include it depends on the project."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:354 301e732b10b14b048d832772551c480b
msgid "多声道下混没有唯一正确答案。不同平台、设备、耳机虚拟环绕、影院标准和游戏风格可能需要不同矩阵。 对关键内容做下混时，必须用实际目标设备听测。"
msgstr ""
"There is no single correct answer for multi-channel downmixing. Different platforms, devices, "
"virtual surround headphones, cinema standards, and game styles may require different matrices. "
"For critical content, always listen on the actual target device."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:360 219f1b0e38974674992ad5c10e54523b
msgid "Callback"
msgstr "Callback"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:362 074a58749fe7405da1272deb95b843cc
msgid "Callback 即回调。FMOD 会在特定事件发生时通知用户代码，例如声音结束、通道状态变化或某些底层系统事件。"
msgstr ""
"Callback means FMOD notifies user code when a specific event occurs, such as a sound ending, a "
"channel state change, or a lower-level system event."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:364 44ecf82fc6004b7a8084cf5fa730a2ab
msgid ""
"在 Godot-FmodPlayer 中，ChannelControl 级别回调会通过 ``callback_received`` 信号转发到 Godot。 每个 "
"System、ChannelControl 或 DSP 通常只维护一个回调入口，因此注册回调时应根据回调类型区分处理逻辑。"
msgstr ""
"In Godot-FmodPlayer, ChannelControl-level callbacks are forwarded to Godot through the "
"``callback_received`` signal. Each System, ChannelControl, or DSP usually maintains one callback "
"entry, so callback registration should branch by callback type."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:370 404fe1eabb0e4fdd8a366481f3ca69de
msgid "System"
msgstr "System"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:372 881d53145fd34d60892994723a5ea9db
msgid "System 是 FMOD Core API 的核心对象，负责初始化音频设备、创建 Sound、播放声音、管理 Channel、更新混音系统、 获取性能数据和处理录音等底层功能。"
msgstr ""
"System is the core object of the FMOD Core API. It initializes audio devices, creates Sounds, "
"plays sounds, manages Channels, updates the mixing system, retrieves performance data, and "
"handles recording."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:375 e152f987a7384657ae4beb098fec36f8
msgid ""
"在 Godot-FmodPlayer 中，通常不需要手动创建 System。插件会通过 :ref:`FmodServer<class_FmodServer>` 初始化并维护主系统。 "
"高级用法可以从 :ref:`FmodServer.get_main_system()<class_FmodServer_method_get_main_system>` 获取 "
":ref:`FmodSystem<class_FmodSystem>`。"
msgstr ""
"In Godot-FmodPlayer, you usually do not create System manually. The plugin initializes and "
"maintains the main system through :ref:`FmodServer<class_FmodServer>`. Advanced usage can start "
"from :ref:`FmodServer.get_main_system()<class_FmodServer_method_get_main_system>` and "
":ref:`FmodSystem<class_FmodSystem>`."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:381 73ebeb3fec7c4c2287fe47a0d1a72f1c
msgid "Bank 与 Event"
msgstr "Bank and Event"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:383 d80069754115408aa6e41c0417faa2bf
msgid ""
"Bank 和 Event 常见于 FMOD 的 Studio 工作流。Godot-FmodPlayer 主要面向 **FMOD Core API**， 重点是音频文件播放、通道控制、DSP "
"效果、混音总线、3D 音频和性能监控。"
msgstr ""
"Bank and Event are common in the FMOD Studio workflow. Godot-FmodPlayer mainly targets the **FMOD"
" Core API**, focusing on audio file playback, channel control, DSP effects, mixing buses, 3D "
"audio, and performance monitoring."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:386 f7f894b12ea6484aa7efb926ffb20763
msgid ""
"因此，在本插件文档中看到 ``Bank`` 或 ``Event`` 时，通常只是为了帮助理解 FMOD 生态中的相关概念。 如果项目需要完整的 FMOD Studio Event、Bank "
"构建、参数自动化和音频设计师工作流， 应选择专门的 FMOD Studio 集成方案，而不是把 Godot-FmodPlayer 当作完整 Studio 集成使用。"
msgstr ""
"Therefore, when ``Bank`` or ``Event`` appears in this plugin documentation, it is usually only to"
" help explain related FMOD ecosystem concepts. If a project needs a full FMOD Studio Event "
"workflow, Bank builds, parameter automation, and audio-designer tooling, choose a dedicated FMOD "
"Studio integration instead of treating Godot-FmodPlayer as one."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:393 63a4b46d254f41a3b53f2869e99e58c8
msgid "FSB"
msgstr "FSB"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:395 b9a48849198f484fa26ab0a33f31e0d2
msgid "FSB 是 FMOD Sample Bank 的缩写，是一种打包采样数据的格式。它和 Studio 工作流中的 Bank 不是同一个概念。"
msgstr ""
"FSB stands for FMOD Sample Bank. It is a format for packed sample data and is not the same "
"concept as a Bank in the Studio workflow."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:397 cf65db922d8f4328b2e85929279959ae
msgid ""
"Godot-FmodPlayer 面向常规音频文件和 FMOD Core API 用法时，通常不需要直接处理 FSB。 如果项目依赖特殊打包格式，应先确认当前目标平台、FMOD Engine "
"版本和插件导入流程是否支持。"
msgstr ""
"For regular audio files and FMOD Core API usage, Godot-FmodPlayer usually does not require direct"
" FSB handling. If your project depends on a special packaged format, first confirm support for "
"the target platform, FMOD Engine version, and plugin import flow."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:403 d2b63ae02f6b4b8e9b0ca0e6570f4c46
msgid "Profiler"
msgstr "Profiler"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:405 8122a2c482fc433fa7a25ae23db61d2e
msgid "Profiler 是用于观察音频系统运行状态的工具。它可以帮助定位 CPU 占用、流式读取、通道数量、DSP 开销和混音问题。"
msgstr ""
"A Profiler is a tool for observing the runtime state of the audio system. It helps locate CPU "
"usage, streaming reads, channel count, DSP cost, and mixing issues."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:407 d4ccb348b2594c13b0c910c9ebedc55f
msgid ""
"Godot-FmodPlayer 会把部分 FMOD 性能数据注册到 Godot 的性能监视器中，例如 ``FmodCPUUsage/DSP``、 ``FmodCPUUsage/Stream``"
" 和 ``FmodFileUsage/StreamBytesRead``。调试卡顿、爆音或加载异常时，建议同时查看 Godot 输出面板和性能监视器。"
msgstr ""
"Godot-FmodPlayer registers some FMOD performance data in Godot's performance monitors, such as "
"``FmodCPUUsage/DSP``, ``FmodCPUUsage/Stream``, and ``FmodFileUsage/StreamBytesRead``. When "
"debugging stutters, pops, or loading issues, check these monitors first."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:413 9117e4a2829f4c888c2ab3ce6bd7027b
msgid "运行库"
msgstr "Runtime Library"

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:415 074b617ca2e74b6693caa3dd8d44dc68
msgid "运行库指 FMOD Engine 在目标平台上的二进制文件，例如 Windows 上的 ``fmod.dll``，Android 上的 ``libfmod.so`` 和相关 Java 文件。"
msgstr ""
"A runtime library is the FMOD Engine binary for the target platform, such as ``fmod.dll`` on "
"Windows or ``libfmod.so`` and related Java files on Android."

#: ../../source/glossary.rst:417 ae484f41458b428798e586edb23fa9f0
msgid ""
"Godot-FmodPlayer 插件本身不分发 FMOD 运行库。你需要根据目标平台从 FMOD 官方渠道获取，并按 :doc:`export` 或 "
":doc:`getting_started/installation` 的说明放到项目中。发布游戏时还需要遵守 FMOD 的许可和署名要求。"
msgstr ""
"Godot-FmodPlayer does not distribute FMOD runtime libraries. Get them from official FMOD channels"
" for your target platform and place them in the project as described in :doc:`export` or "
":doc:`getting_started/installation`. When publishing a game, you must also follow FMOD licensing "
"and attribution requirements."
